{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_17","type":"agent_message","text":"The current best model has macro AUC 0.830718 versus g0’s 0.830198, with lower click and purchase AUC. It still uses learned event attention after the uniform state read, so the source of the gain is unresolved.\n\nI’ll prepare controls that replace the branch’s g0 state content with token identities, replace learned event pooling with a masked mean, and apply the same residual transform to the existing DIN summary. An exact incumbent replay will anchor the comparison.\n"}}
